    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "id": "Brl4L",
      "x": 5651,
      "y": 10550,
      "name": "R3 Prompt Utility",
      "model": "cursor-composer",
      "width": 400,
      "height": 219,
      "content": "Design a dashboard with a sidebar on the left into \"dashboard-utility\" frame for a utility company showing current usage and a history in a table."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "b7DfAy",
      "x": -298,
      "y": 7498,
      "name": "S Title",
      "fill": "#A5B4F0",
      "content": "【S · 最终项目效果 / Canonical Routed Screens】",
      "fontFamily": "Geist",
      "fontSize": 64,
      "fontWeight": "700"
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "c5eEjc",
      "x": -298,
      "y": 7888,
      "name": "Details Section S",
      "width": 2500,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Cr4cX",
          "name": "Section S Details",
          "fill": "#F5F5F5",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "S 是项目唯一视觉与页面逻辑目标。所有页面统一使用 A 的令牌、B 的公共组件和 C 的组合模块；R2/R3 只作为 shadcn 模板与提示词来源，R1 只提供 CVC 业务语义证据。\n- 第一行：Light 主题正式页面。\n- 第二行：Dark 主题同构页面，共用同一套主题变量。\n- S2 是 /workbench 的 New Project 状态，不是独立路由。\n- Inspector 固定为 Data · Source · Gates · Execution 四页签。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Geist",
          "fontSize": 44,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "vMxo9",
      "x": -298,
      "y": 10550,
      "name": "Annotation Section R",
      "width": 2500,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 28,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Tey56",
          "name": "Section R Title",
          "fill": "#A5B4F0",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "【R 区域：模板与探索来源 (Source Archive)】",
          "fontFamily": "Geist",
          "fontSize": 64,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "e6WEAy",
          "name": "Section R Details",
          "fill": "#F5F5F5",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "R 仅保留仍有复用价值的两类来源，不属于当前产品依赖链，也不得被 S 页面直接引用。已删除被 Canonical A–D/B0 完全替代的 Legacy CVC v1 / Apple-like 组件体系。\n- R2 shadcn source kit：保留结构模板、组件模式与基础提示词参考。\n- R3 generated dashboard explorations：保留布局探索和提示词样本。\nR2/R3 保持原始外观，不参与 Canonical Header 同步。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Geist",
          "fontSize": 48,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "CLzsu",
      "x": -298,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "A · Canonical Foundations",
      "width": 2500,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "xIO3I",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "#A5B4F0",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "【A · 唯一基础规范 / Canonical Foundations】",
          "fontFamily": "Geist",
          "fontSize": 64,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "daaVH",
          "name": "Details",
          "fill": "#F5F5F5",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "以经典 shadcn 结构为模板，统一为 Geist 字体、Zinc 中性色、1px 边界与紧凑圆角。颜色只表达层级与真实状态；旧 Apple-like 与 Pi 渐变体系不再作为实现指南。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Geist",
          "fontSize": 44,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
